 "text": "Equalization and Assessment Limitations | Department of Revenue\nSkip to main content\nOfficial State of Iowa Website\nAgencies A-Z\nPrograms & Services\nDepartment of Revenue\n| ×\n|\n| |\n|\nSearch\nMenu\nMain navigation\nTaxes\nTaxes sub-navigation\nFile My Taxes\nBusiness Permit Registration\nWhere's My Refund\nMake a Payment\nVerify My Identity\nFile a W-2 or 1099\nTax Guidance\nTax Professionals\nSales Tax Lookup\nAccess GovConnectIowa\nReport Fraud & Identity Theft\nProperty Assessment Appeal Board\nFrequently Asked Questions\nAlcohol\nAlcohol sub-navigation\nAlcohol Licensing\nManage Your License\nProducts & Ordering\nAlcohol Guidance\nRegulation & Complaints\nAlcohol & Tobacco Education\nBrokers and Suppliers\nAlcoholic Beverages Commission\nTobacco & Vapor\nTobacco & Vapor sub-navigation\nGet a Retailer Permit\nCompliance\nFines & Penalties\nCigarette & Tobacco Taxes\nSmokefree Air Act\nFrequently Asked Questions\nLottery\nResources\nResources sub-navigation\nLaw & Policy Information\nAdopted & Filed Rules\nThird Party Authorization\nGovConnectIowa Help\nLocal Government\nTax Credits Tracking & Analysis\nReports\nTaxpayer Bill of Rights\nResearch & Statistics\nWebinars\nRevenue Research Library\nForms\nForms sub-navigation\nIA 1040 Instructions\nCommon Forms\nAbout\nAbout sub-navigation\nIntern\nContact\nCareers\nPILOT Task Force\nAgencies A-Z\nOnline Services\nBreadcrumbs\nHome\nTaxes\nTax Guidance\nProperty Tax\nEqualization and Assessment Limitations\nTopics:\nProperty Tax\nList items for Equalization and Assessment Limitations\nEqualization\n2025 Equalization Orders (757.18 KB) Archived .pdf\n2023 Equalization Orders (445.34 KB) Archived .pdf\n2021 Equalization Orders (244.77 KB) Archived .pdf\n2019 Equalization Orders (53.79 KB) Archived .pdf\n2017 Equalization Orders (53.74 KB) Archived .pdf\n2015 Equalization Orders (46.28 KB) Archived .pdf\n2013 Equalization Orders (60.53 KB) Archived .pdf\n2011 Equalization Orders (10.38 KB) Archived .pdf\n2009 Equalization Orders (14.51 KB) Archived .pdf\n2007 Equalization Orders (60.53 KB) Archived .pdf\nAssessment Limitations\n2025 Order Certifying Percentages for Assessment Limitations (730.62 KB) Archived .pdf\nTo view the History of Assessment Limitations, visit the Assessor Portal and select View Assessment Limitations under About this Portal .\nAgriculture\nTo view the Agricultural Productivity Per Acre Values, visit the Assessor Portal and select View Agricultural Productivity Values under About this Portal .\nProtest to Local Board of Review\nProtests are accepted by the board of review between October 9 up to and including October 31.\nProtests must be in writing.\nThe only ground for protesting to the local board of review reconvened in special session pursuant to Iowa Code section 441.49 is that the application of the Department’s final equalization order results in a value greater than that permitted under Iowa Code section 441.21.\nLocal Board of Review Action\nLocal boards of review can only remove the amount of the increase due to the equalization order.\nThe local board of review mails its decision to the taxpayer.\nAppeals to the Property Assessment Appeal Board or District Court\nThe taxpayer may file an appeal with the Property Assessment Appeal Board within 20 days after the board of review’s adjournment.\nThe taxpayer may bypass the Property Assessment Appeal Board and appeal to district court within 20 days after the board of review’s adjournment.\nAssessing Jurisdictions in which an Alternative Method has been Approved: Extended Deadline\nIf an alternative method of applying the equalization order has been approved by the Department, the special session of the local board of review to hear equalization protests shall be extended to November 30. In such instances, protests may be filed up to and including November 4.\nSecondary Navigation Menu\nProperty Tax\nIowa Property Tax Overview\nAbstract Reconciliation\nAssessor Education\nElectronic Filing\nEqualization and Assessment Limitations\nTwo-Tier Assessment Limitations\nHomestead Tax Credit and Exemption\nIowa Hotel and Motel Tax\nIowa Real Property Appraisal Manual\nIowa Vehicle Purchase, Lease, and Rental Information\nProperty Tax - Utilities\nProperty Tax Credit Expanded\nUtility Replacement Tax Basics\nUtility Replacement Tax Task Force\nWind Energy\nWorkday Learning Local Gov\nDepartment of Revenue\nFooter Social Media Menu\nOpens in a new window.\nOpens in a new window.\nOpens in a new window.\nOpens in a new window.\nPhone\n515-281-3114\nHow can we help?\nShare feedback with us\nFooter Menu\nFooter\nAbout\nContact\nNews\nSubscribe\nTaxpayer Rights\nAccessibility Assistance\nArchived Documents\nContact Menu\nSend Feedback\n© 2026 State of Iowa - Read our accessibility, data, privacy, and other policies .\n| |\nGive Feedback",
